      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I am only addressing the TOCTOU race condition here. Rejecting `GH_VM_SET_USER_MEM_REGION` ioctl while VM is not in INIT state can be taken up later after internal discussion. I don\u0027t want to change user behavior or limit any of future work related to this issue. Currently, this patch fixes the race condition. The behavior is same. The ioctl will succed but silently ignored or if it races with this , we will catch it here an fail it.",
